# TAA by the camera (docs/graphics-plan.md, step 1a): the same four clips with OPENGOTHIC_TAA=0 (CMAA2) and =1,
# judged side by side as clips, not stills (reports/render-features/2026-11-03-taa).
# 1920x1080, as the player sees it:
#   OPENGOTHIC_TAA=0 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/taa-clips.bench
#   OPENGOTHIC_TAA=1 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/taa-clips.bench
# measure: reports/render-features/2026-11-03-taa/metrics.py <CMAA2 out> <TAA out>
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
# 1. The market at noon: the hero walks, the camera follows, passers-by around (their trails until step 1b)
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode walk
cam look 120
cam follow 380 170 160
wait 10000
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 500
rec taa-market
wait 7000
stop
# 2. The forest road: leaves in the wind, the camera holds still
cam cut
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_16
watch player
cam look 150
cam world 500 230 0
wait 10000
cam hold
rec taa-forest
wait 7000
stop
# 3. A slow turn of the camera on the spot by the market roofs: it stands, the hero walks off and it turns after him
cam cut
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode walk
cam look 350
cam world 700 280 270
wait 10000
cam fixed
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_SHOP01_FRONT_03
wait 500
rec taa-roofs-turn
wait 7000
stop
# 4. Flicker: the camera stands at noon on the way from the city to the farms, a tree in the wind, a fence and
# tall grass against the sky
cam cut
set time 12 0
goto NW_FARM1_PATH_CITY_13
watch player
cam look 300
cam world 600 200 180
wait 10000
cam hold
wait 1000
rec taa-flicker
wait 7000
stop
# 5. The harbour at midnight: the fishers' corner from 7 m, two of their three burning braziers, a net rack
# (fire and smoke are translucent, without a mask until step 1c); the shot of harbour-motion-night.bench
cam cut
set time 0 0
cam look -2033.524
goto pos -3202.329 1917.000 -3435.690
cam world 5999.906 -2000.000 -155.224859
wait 34
cam hold
wait 8000
set time 0 0
rec taa-harbour-night
wait 7000
stop
